\usepackage{wasysym}
\usepackage{amsfonts}
\usepackage{amssymb}
\usepackage{amsbsy}
\usepackage{upgreek}
\usepackage{mathrsfs}
\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
\begin{document}
$\boldsymbol{p_l^{\textit{query}}} \in{{\mathbb{R}}^k}$\end{document}
across each run
l
, which are projected onto the annotated reference PCA space performed with the stats package [
21
]. A
k
-nearest neighbours classifier is trained on the reference PCA scores and their known labels using the class R package [
22
]. Each query cell is classified by identifying its
k
-nearest neighbours in the reference space (default
