Coralysis reference-mapping method
The Coralysis reference-mapping method enables projection of unannotated query datasets onto annotated reference datasets with known cell types using solely the ICP framework. This allows efficiently transferring cell type labels to new data without the need to retrain ICP on the query data, relying on the already trained ICP models. The procedure begins by running the original or divisive ICP
L
