Integrating similar unshared cell type pairs
Two PBMC scRNA-seq samples, one representing resting PBMCs (CTRL) and other PBMCs stimulated with interferon (STIM), were used to highlight the ability of Coralysis to integrate similar unshared cell type pairs across batches. The
